    "en": "The stochastic lattice Lotka-Volterra model: prey are born in an empty neighbouring cell (σ), a predator that finds prey turns it into its offspring (λ) and dies at random (μ). Its mean-field equation is da/dt = σa(1−a−b) − λab, db/dt = λab − μb."
